+| 任务统一进度/取消 | BackgroundService 提供进度、取消、状态查询 | `services/background_service.py` |
+| 测试 | 121 个 pytest 用例 | `tests/` |
+| 升级与上游监测 | `upgrade.sh`、`upgrade-upstream.sh`、`watch-upstream.py`、冲突保留原则 | `scripts/` |
+| 轻量模式 | `LITE_*` 可裁剪分页、列表字段、封面、推荐等 | `webserver/perf.py`、`settings.py` |
